<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $186 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $186 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Friday it placed $186 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 6.85 percent from 7.05 percent at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar slipped to 0.99951 pesos from 0.99983 pesos Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0657</p>
